@startuml
title 04  |  Cancellation and supersession

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #37678C
  LifeLineBorderColor #A9BAC8
  ParticipantBorderColor #476782
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #EAF3FA
  ActorBorderColor #476782
  ActorBackgroundColor #EAF3FA
  GroupBorderColor #91AAC0
  GroupBackgroundColor #F5F9FC
  NoteBorderColor #D7B766
  NoteBackgroundColor #FFF8E7
}

actor Shopper
boundary "Streamlit UI" as UI
control "Run controller" as Controller
control "Single LangGraph" as Graph
control "Source / model adapter" as Adapter
database "SQLite repository" as Store

Shopper -> UI: Submit request v1
UI -> Controller: Create run ID and request_version 1
Controller -> Graph: Start v1 with limits
Graph -> Adapter: Start permitted bounded call

Shopper -> UI: Cancel or correct v1
UI -> Controller: Cancel v1; increment version if corrected
Controller -> Graph: Set cancellation flag for v1
opt Corrected request starts v2
  Controller -> Graph: Dispatch v2 with fresh run context
end

Adapter --> Graph: Previously started call completes
Graph --> Controller: Late v1 outcome
Controller -> Controller: Reject stale/cancelled version;\nstart no further v1 calls
Controller -> Store: Persist redacted terminal event only
Store --> Controller: Event status
Controller --> UI: Keep current UI state or v2 result
UI --> Shopper: Show current outcome

note over Controller, Store
  Raw graph checkpoints and personal inputs
  are not persisted.
end note
@enduml
